<title>BELGIUM: BBL CUTS SAVINGS BOOK RATE.</title>
<headline>BBL CUTS SAVINGS BOOK RATE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian BBL said on Friday it</p>
<p>would cut the base rate on its savings book accounts to 2.25</p>
<p>percent from 2.50 percent from Monday.</p>
<p>The fidelity premium remains unchanged at 0.5 percent, the</p>
<p>rowth premium at 1.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
